    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this lovely two-bedroom ground floor apartment in fantastic condition throughout to the market ideally tucked away in the highly sought-after Courthouse development in Rathcoole a hugely sought-after location. This superb development is ideally located in the heart of Rathcoole Village and every conceivable local amenity can be found within walking distance including shops, restaurants, An Poitin Stil, Schools, Rathcoole Park and Avoca, the location is truly next to none. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious living accommodation of c. 64 sqm comprises of entrance hall with storage room, fully fitted kitchen, open plan living/dining area with double doors to a sunny south facing balcony, two double bedrooms and a main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. \r\n\r\nNo. 28 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owner with plenty of additional features such as generous living space, built in wardrobes, fully tiled bathroom suite and underground parking to name but a few this one boasts an ideal opportunity for a keen first-time buyer to take that step onto the property ladder but equally as popular with investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area. \r\n\r\nEarly interest is expected, be sure to contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nFeatures \r\n- C. 64 sqm \r\n- C1 BER\r\n- Management fees c 1,900 yearly \r\n- 2 bed 1 bath \r\n- Situated on the ground floor\r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom\r\n- Top quality flooring \r\n- Well-proportioned room sizes \r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Storage room \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Open plan living/dining \r\n- Two double bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Main family bathroom fully tiled \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Top quality blinds\r\n- Mature & peaceful surroundings \r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- Designated parking \r\n- Over ground & underground parking \r\n- Every conceivable amenity within walking distance \r\n- Close to M50/N7 \r\n- LOCATION LOCATION LOCATION \r\n- Right in the heart of Rathcoole village \r\n- Ideal for 1st time buyers\r\n- Fantastic yields for investors \r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom Avoca, drive straight into Rathcoole Village, continue straight through the village where right in the middle you will find the Courthouse nestled at the back of Paddy Power and the Rathcoole inn."
      },
      {
